rated filer, an accelerated filer, a non-accelerated filer, a smaller reporting company, or an emerging growth company. See the definitions of &#8220;large accelerated filer,&#8221; &#8220;accelerated filer,&#8221; &#8220;smaller reporting company,&#8221; and &#8220;emerging growth company&#8221; in Rule&#160;12b-2 of the Exchange Act.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt;"><span style="font-size:7pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-left:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:56.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;">Large accelerated filer <span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';">&#9723;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:43.67%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"><ix:nonNumeric format="ixt-sec:entityfilercategoryen" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2025_To_7_31_2026_eReVYQpgmUGRZQ8cIfSaGA" name="dei:EntityFilerCategory" id="Narr_iOLHF4v-OkWlhBmth4buVA">Accelerated filer</ix:nonNumeric> <span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';">&#8999;</span></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:56.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;">Non-accelerated filer <span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';">&#9723;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:43.67%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;">Smaller reporting company <ix:nonNumeric format="ixt:fixed-true" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2025_To_7_31_2026_eReVY