ility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_1_2025_To_7_31_2026_eReVYQpgmUGRZQ8cIfSaGA" name="us-gaap:DisclosureOfCompensationRelatedCostsShareBasedPaymentsTextBlock" id="Tb_F77-0rviiEiqm_DAvb421Q" continuedAt="Tb_F77-0rviiEiqm_DAvb421Q_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">4.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;EQUITY INCENTIVE PLAN</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">In March 2016, we adopted the Hurco Companies, Inc. 2016 Equity Incentive Plan (as amended, the &#8220;2016 Equity Plan&#8221;), which allows us to grant awards of stock options, stock appreciation rights, restricted stock, stock units and other stock-based awards. &#160;The 2016 Equity Plan replaced the Hurco Companies, Inc. 2008 Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2008 Equity Plan&#8221;) and is the only active plan under which equity awards may be made by us to our employees and non-employee directors. &#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_o-G1d5U1tUyreTepv3mABg" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2025_To_7_31_2026_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_hurc_TwoThousandAndEightMember_LhWPBSs_QkW9RATZ-yqgWw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_cpVGQynDMkGZ3okW5qDGoQ">No</ix:nonFraction> further awards will be made under our 2008 Equity Plan. &#160;The total number of shares of our common stock that may be issued pursuant to awards under the 2016 Equity Plan was initially <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_o-G1d5U1tUyreTepv3mABg" contextRef="As_Of_3_10_2016_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_hurc_TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_Rde1meldHkCz76bPnPxCrA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_ICeqQ76Bx060ZtY77zekcQ">856,048</ix:nonFraction>, which included <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_o-G1d5U1tUyreTepv3mABg" contextRef="As_Of_3_10_2016_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_hurc_TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_Rde1meldHkCz76bPnPxCrA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="0" id="Narr_KmUzQWKpaUa8fd376Kt0cQ">386,048</ix:nonFraction> shares that remained available for future grants under the 2008 Equity Plan as of March 10, 2016, the date our shareholders approved the 2016 Equity Plan. &#160;On March 10, 2022, our shareholders approved the Amended and Restated Hurco Companies, Inc. 2016 Equity Incentive Plan, which, among other items, increased the aggregate number of shares that may be issued under the 2016 Equity Plan by <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_o-G1d5U1tUyreTepv3mABg" contextRef="Duration_3_10_2022_To_3_10_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_hurc_TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_g_Bsuti-fE6i8Q5o7-b1cw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_MzO6Tk8w9EWNnywtPhtLYA">850,000</ix:nonFraction> shares. &#160;On March 13, 2025, our shareholders approved an amendment to the 2016 Equity Plan, which increased the aggregate number of shares that may be issued thereunder by an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_o-G1d5U1tUyreTepv3mABg" contextRef="Duration_3_13_2025_To_3_13_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_hurc_TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_QNjew6YzNUa8AIZa6d6vDg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_47QQQXUEdUmd4_iJVYbefA">850,000</ix:nonFraction> shares.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The Compensation Committee of our Board of Directors has the authority to determine the officers, directors, and key employees who will be granted awards under the 2016 Equity Plan; designate the number of shares subject to each award; determine the terms and conditions upon which awards will be granted; and prescribe the form and terms of award agreements. We have granted restricted shares and performance stock units under the 2016 Equity Plan that are currently outstanding. The market value of a share of our common stock, for purposes of the 2016 Equity Plan, is the closing sale price as reported by the Nasdaq Global Select Market on the date in question or, if not a trading day, on the last preceding trading date.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On March 12, 2026, the Compensation Committee granted a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_o-G1d5U1tUyreTepv3mABg" contextRef="Duration_3_12_2026_To_3_12_2026_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_Pifd1dsL0keJDQ7tM5YeVQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_7VORmpS5EUqeq2XI9seaQA">38,024</ix:nonFraction> shares of time-based restricted stock to our non-employee directors. The restricted shares vest in full <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_3_12_2026_To_3_12_2026_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_Pifd1dsL0keJDQ7tM5YeVQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_fa4WgJqS_E6NITae10ULKQ">one year</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant provided the recipient remains on the board of directors through that date. The grant date fair value of the restricted shares was based on the closing sales price of our common stock on the grant date, which was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_wBDic4q7PEGZn32X7LKtyQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_12_2026_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_ud-TegUc0U6T71Fn3odRgw" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_eMgdTTDhpkyR7Hq0obXt8A">14.725</ix:nonFraction> per share.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">12</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="Tc_8-QmfH4dHUmv11GCdsWL7w_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_6MLX9OvAakWdkM9rIB3f0Q_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_tEPLQAl3fECBBHTAagb_fw_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_xg1_jstOZ0-xnaMPzB6TYA_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_4g-q3o_KU02erHQSHDgE2w_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_eBvOTS1z_U-hETNnfS22wQ_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_iXfwGRprZU6WEqvSI91soA_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_9LvbsUfja0efo0yceusU-Q_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_XWimlBUFA0y6pkAGbY5tCQ_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_EtzPbYX990uj2XHxF3phow_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_kmY3sxkyokC5uSQSZilS8Q_8_4"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_F77-0rviiEiqm_DAvb421Q_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On January 6, 2026, the Compensation Committee approved a long-term incentive compensation arrangement for our executive officers in the form of time-based restricted shares and performance stock units (&#8220;PSUs&#8221;), which will be payable in shares of our common stock if earned and vested. The awards were approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_8daAT1xTG0-1taMDW5mpHA" contextRef="As_Of_1_6_2026_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_BWGemDWI5Ui47BBlUeBxKQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_zavxcBMXgEq0z2558DasNw">45</ix:nonFraction>% time-based vesting and approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_8daAT1xTG0-1taMDW5mpHA" contextRef="As_Of_1_6_2026_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_F8hh2BcLK0eD14xEC-plFA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_ml7Ve_COnUS_oyS6Qicg8Q">55</ix:nonFraction>% performance-based vesting. The <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_6_2026_To_1_6_2026_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_zMzr4hEgyEui34FihqQ88Q" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_bLOJPlZXNUSoA3UkT1et8g">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> performance period for the PSUs is fiscal year 2026 through fiscal year 2028.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On that date, the Compensation Committee granted a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_o-G1d5U1tUyreTepv3mABg" contextRef="Duration_1_6_2026_To_1_6_2026_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_Vs79WbwlOUKq5wOlV4tCFQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_bGB4B8yvukK2BWL_I-5ilQ">66,491</ix:nonFraction> shares of time-based restricted stock to our executive officers. &#160;The restricted shares vest in thirds over <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_6_2026_To_1_6_2026_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_Vs79WbwlOUKq5wOlV4tCFQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_XZYYQNhA3k-jSbu6sUVemw">three years</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant provided the recipient continues service with the company through that date. &#160;The grant date fair value of the restricted shares was based upon the closing sales price of our common stock on the date of grant, which was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_wBDic4q7PEGZn32X7LKtyQ" contextRef="As_Of_1_6_2026_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_BWGemDWI5Ui47BBlUeBxKQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_YxHV2BcW3k-R-NLRHltmJw">16.29</ix:nonFraction> per share.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On January 6, 2026, the Compensation Committee also granted a total target number of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_o-G1d5U1tUyreTepv3mABg" contextRef="Duration_1_6_2026_To_1_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PsuTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_uNm7q1FkOEG9IlMzozKjxQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_ZMjoZ5F6gUi0vGaKcIZXkQ">44,327</ix:nonFraction> PSUs to our executive officers designated as &#8220;PSU &#8211; NI&#8221;. These PSUs were weighted as approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_8daAT1xTG0-1taMDW5mpHA" contextRef="As_Of_1_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PsuTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_kAKXWk8sPESuWGX9F3a3xA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_nrNpHNB5zEKYMowsHeAYEA">30</ix:nonFraction>% of the overall 2026 executive long-term incentive compensation arrangement and will vest and be paid based upon the achievement of pre-established goals related to our average net income over the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_6_2026_To_1_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PsuTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_uNm7q1FkOEG9IlMzozKjxQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_KH5C-8CBIEy_2uD-anCQcQ">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> period of fiscal years 2026-2028. Participants will have the ability to earn between <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_8daAT1xTG0-1taMDW5mpHA" contextRef="As_Of_1_6_2026_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PsuTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_jmUgEOKQwE2Ny82UZ69jJg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_pp4Q_lITF0OsM2VUgXI1oA">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; NI for achieving threshold performance and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_8daAT1xTG0-1taMDW5mpHA" contextRef="As_Of_1_6_2026_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PsuTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_7xJwDxd0J0-GNiNuQb9C4Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_xvWklYBewUK0E38EF3eajQ">200</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; NI for achieving maximum performance. The grant date fair value of the PSUs &#8211; NI was based on the closing sales price of our common stock on the grant date, which was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_wBDic4q7PEGZn32X7LKtyQ" contextRef="As_Of_1_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PsuTsrMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_kAKXWk8sPESuWGX9F3a3xA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_g__xVSBol0u1U-EeJARE9A">16.29</ix:nonFraction> per PSU.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On January 6, 2026, the Compensation Committee also granted a total target number of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_o-G1d5U1tUyreTepv3mABg" contextRef="Duration_1_6_2026_To_1_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PsuRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_2kEv0sNjVkCpBcq3yl8Tpg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_ZEe5YbrJZE2lgpeY6rdDLg">36,940</ix:nonFraction> PSUs to our executive officers designated as &#8220;PSU &#8211; FCF&#8221;. These PSUs were weighted as approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_8daAT1xTG0-1taMDW5mpHA" contextRef="As_Of_1_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PsuRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_HIEJZT6ugEev4T4GcFEhbQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOverallIncentiveCompensationArrangement" scale="-2" id="Narr_nqznIGriR0efYx0Ky-8BzA">25</ix:nonFraction>% of the overall 2026 executive long-term incentive compensation arrangement and will vest and be paid based upon the achievement of pre-established goals related to our average free cash flow over the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_6_2026_To_1_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PsuRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_2kEv0sNjVkCpBcq3yl8Tpg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_Rx0yo9wuvkecwK-CXRtSCg">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> period of fiscal years 2026-2028. Participants will have the ability to earn between <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_8daAT1xTG0-1taMDW5mpHA" contextRef="As_Of_1_6_2026_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PsuRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_oyatZx0tiUmjwY8eie6GcA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_DMmvNHXLDEai-FDvOGicUw">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; FCF for achieving threshold performance and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_8daAT1xTG0-1taMDW5mpHA" contextRef="As_Of_1_6_2026_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PsuRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_wt-3q_1KnECT4p9nyDDFtQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="hurc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfTargetNumberOfSharesToBeEarned" scale="-2" id="Narr_oat2JSwGykaC51fPboTv0w">200</ix:nonFraction>% of the target number of the PSUs &#8211; FCF for achieving maximum performance. The grant date fair value of the PSUs &#8211; FCF was based on the closing sales price of our common stock on the grant date, which was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_wBDic4q7PEGZn32X7LKtyQ" contextRef="As_Of_1_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_hurc_PsuRoicMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_PerformanceBasedMember_HIEJZT6ugEev4T4GcFEhbQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_AB1MSyFjQU-QvvwvNmlMjw">16.29</ix:nonFraction> per PSU.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On November 12, 2025, the Compensation Committee granted a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_o-G1d5U1tUyreTepv3mABg" contextRef="Duration_11_12_2025_To_11_12_2025_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_cBNzbb8cFUiuxrEhxUlBWw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_aYuccALpd0uyorVHIVRuzA">20,260</ix:nonFraction> shares of time-based restricted stock to our non-executive employees. The restricted shares vest in thirds over <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_11_12_2025_To_11_12_2025_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_cBNzbb8cFUiuxrEhxUlBWw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_3nqeCF2sPkC1RwaiGRVYEg">three years</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant provided the recipient continues service with the company through that date. The grant date fair value of the restricted shares was based upon the closing sales price of our common stock on the date of grant, which was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_wBDic4q7PEGZn32X7LKtyQ" contextRef="As_Of_11_12_2025_us-gaap_VestingAxis_hurc_TimeBasedMember_LnTD6ym8KEOnSW9VyZ7pPA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_HtQdx3ABqkS8bY2Y-N-W6g">16.65</ix:nonFraction> per share.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="f